# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# LOCAL ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION EXAMPLE
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Copy this file to .env.local and customize according to YOUR environment
# Each developer on the team should have their own .env.local based on
# their local setup (MAMP, XAMPP, WAMP, Docker, etc.)
#
# IMPORTANT: .env.local is gitignored and should NOT be committed!
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# TIMEZONE ALIGNMENT (PHP + MYSQL)
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Keep app timezone explicit and consistent.
# APP_TIMEZONE=UTC

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# UPLOAD CONFIGURATION
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# These variables control where user-uploaded files (avatars, documents, etc.) 
# are stored and how they are accessed via URLs.
#
# UPLOADS_BASE_DIR = Physical directory where files are stored (on disk)
# UPLOADS_BASE_URL = URL path to access those files in the browser
#
# Choose the configuration that matches YOUR local setup:

# ── MAMP (macOS) ──
# UPLOADS_BASE_DIR="/Applications/MAMP/htdocs/agrilink/uploads"
# UPLOADS_BASE_URL="/agrilink/uploads"

# ── MAMP (Windows) ──
# UPLOADS_BASE_DIR="C:/MAMP/htdocs/agrilink/uploads"
# UPLOADS_BASE_URL="/agrilink/uploads"

# ── XAMPP (Windows) ──
# UPLOADS_BASE_DIR="C:/xampp/htdocs/agrilink/uploads"
# UPLOADS_BASE_URL="/agrilink/uploads"

# ── XAMPP (macOS) ──
# UPLOADS_BASE_DIR="/Applications/XAMPP/htdocs/agrilink/uploads"
# UPLOADS_BASE_URL="/agrilink/uploads"

# ── XAMPP (Linux) ──
# UPLOADS_BASE_DIR="/opt/lampp/htdocs/agrilink/uploads"
# UPLOADS_BASE_URL="/agrilink/uploads"

# ── WAMP (Windows) ──
# UPLOADS_BASE_DIR="C:/wamp64/www/agrilink/uploads"
# UPLOADS_BASE_URL="/agrilink/uploads"

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# IMPORTANT SETUP STEPS
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# 1. UNCOMMENT the configuration that matches YOUR setup above
#
# 2. CREATE the uploads directory structure in your htdocs/agrilink/:
#    
#    For Windows (XAMPP/WAMP/MAMP):
#    └── C:\xampp\htdocs\agrilink\uploads\
#        └── profiles\
#        └── equipements\
#
#    For macOS (MAMP/XAMPP):
#    └── /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/agrilink/uploads/
#        └── profiles/
#        └── equipements/
#
#    For Linux (XAMPP):
#    └── /opt/lampp/htdocs/agrilink/uploads/
#        └── profiles/
#        └── equipements/
#
# 3. Ensure the directories are writable:
#    - macOS/Linux: chmod 755 uploads/
#    - Windows: Right-click → Properties → Security → Ensure your user has Full Control
#
# 4. CLEAR SYMFONY CACHE after updating .env.local:
#    php bin/console cache:clear
#
# 5. TEST: Try uploading an avatar - it should store in htdocs/agrilink/uploads/
#          and display correctly in your profile
#
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
